ediately by **intravitreal injection of broad-spectrum empiric antibiotics** (typically **Vancomycin** for Gram-positives and **Ceftazidime** or Amikacin for Gram-negatives). If the patient''s visual acuity is Light Perception (LP) or worse, the Endophthalmitis Vitrectomy Study (EVS) guidelines recommend immediate **pars plana vitrectomy (PPV)**.'),
